{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓團BLACK PINK成員Jisoo昨日飛抵泰國，今午現身曼谷的商場，出席健康飲品的宣傳活動，吸引大批泰迷熱捧。</p><p>行程緊密的Jisoo，前日啟程時被拍得一臉倦容，在機場閉目養神，令一眾粉絲十分心疼。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T15:23:01.765697+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T15:05:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T15:16:28.042176+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T15:16:28.042176+00:00","content_hash":"e36ab20b61ee1fe7d3cc92b2d43ea7189a4c72deeda57a7204f935117c97b248","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}